<%@ include file="../common/header.jsp" %>
<main class="content-shell content-shell--public">
    <section class="section-card section-card--hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Purpose</p>
        <h1>Make online communities slower, safer, and more useful.</h1>
        <p class="lead-sm">Socius is a text-first community platform for people who want focused discussion without noise, harassment, or throwaway posting. It gives members, moderators, and administrators clear tools for building spaces that reward care, accountability, and shared learning.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="split-section">
        <div class="section-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Why Socius Exists</p>
            <h2>Most platforms reward speed. Socius rewards care.</h2>
            <p>Fast feeds can turn useful conversations into noise. Socius is built around moderated communities, thoughtful posting, and clear role-based responsibility so every space can grow without losing trust.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="section-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">How It Works</p>
            <h2>Members create spaces. Moderators keep them healthy.</h2>
            <p>Members can create communities, join discussions, submit posts, and follow feedback. Moderators review sensitive content and reports, while administrators manage users, communities, and platform governance.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Core Principles</p>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li>Text-first clarity keeps conversations readable, searchable, and focused.</li>
            <li>Community ownership lets members create and join spaces around shared interests.</li>
            <li>Guided moderation gives reviewers the context to approve, reject, report, warn, or ban fairly.</li>
            <li>Transparent roles make member, moderator, and administrator authority easy to understand.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</main>
